From ad661a1e89ba52d9926c8298d2bae7091f4189ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "vincent.yen" <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 00:55:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support per-update firmware apply options

Implement StartUpdateOptions while preserving the existing StartUpdate
interface and update flow.

Parse ResetSettingsToDefault from the update options and expose its value
through the per-upload ApplyOptions ClearConfig property. Request a BMC
factory reset after a successful immediate firmware update when
ClearConfig is enabled.

Provide a compatibility handler for other software update targets that
currently ignore the supplied options.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
